{
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "ba24a848-b84f-4bcd-903e-4b7625284fc9",
      "name": "ForeignExchangeRates",
      "description": {
        "content": "`ForeignExchangeRate` records the daily exchange rates Embat uses to convert amounts between currencies for accounting purposes. Each record captures the rates observed on a given `date` for a set of currencies against a `baseCurrency` (EUR as stored).\n\nThese are the same rates Embat applies internally when it computes exchange rates and accounting amounts on entities such as `Payment`, `Balance` and `Transaction`. Foreign exchange rates are read-only reference data: this API does not support creating, updating or deleting them.\n\n**Typical flow:** look up the rate for a given day to reproduce or audit a currency conversion made elsewhere in Embat.\n\n1. List the rates for a date range, optionally expressed against a currency other than EUR:\n\n```\nGET /foreignexchangerates?baseCurrency=USD&startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-01-31\n```\n\n2. Or retrieve a single record you already know the `id` of, always expressed against EUR:\n\n```\nGET /foreignexchangerates/{id}\n```\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "7c2ba37b-335f-4c4b-a1a1-90ab52a0fa9e",
          "name": "List foreign exchange rates",
          "request": {
            "name": "List foreign exchange rates",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns the daily foreign exchange rates recorded in Embat, most recent first, recalculated to be expressed against `baseCurrency`. Results are paginated: use `limit` to control page size and pass the returned `nextPageToken` to fetch the next page. `startDate`/`endDate` filter by rate date: `startDate` is inclusive and `endDate` is exclusive. If only one of the two is given, the range is open-ended on the other side.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "foreignexchangerates"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "baseCurrency",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) Currency all returned `rates` are expressed against."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "startDate",
                  "value": "<date>",
                  "description": "Only return exchange rates dated on or after this date (inclusive)."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "endDate",
                  "value": "<date>",
                  "description": "Only return exchange rates dated before this date (exclusive)."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "500",
                  "description": "Maximum number of objects to return in the response. Default 500, maximum 2000."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "nextPageToken",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Token to fetch the next page of results, taken from the `nextPageToken` returned by the previous request with the same filters. Omit it to fetch the first page. An invalid or malformed token is rejected with `404`."
                }
              ],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{bearerToken}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
